{"product_id":"south-by-south-east-a-diamond-brothers-story","title":"South by South East (A Diamond Brothers Story)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThirteen-year-old Nick Diamond is in prison! Framed for a jewel heist, quick-thinking Nick finds himself sharing a cell with public enemy number one: Johnny Powers. Nicks only chance of clearing his name is to nail the Fence, the countrys master criminal. But to do that, he needs to break outwhich is where his bumbling older brother, Tim, comes in. Nicks not so sure hell make it to his fourteenth birthday! \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:128 x 194  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Anthony Horowitz \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780744590371 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 170\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44902038700185,"sku":"10RA9780744590371","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/d00287334ce66ed57cd37e95b4cbb00a.jpg?v=1729179750","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/south-by-south-east-a-diamond-brothers-story","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}